.vscode/

# Stray binaries from `go build ./test/e2e/runner` without -o, which names the
# output after the package directory and drops it in the working directory.
/runner
/mockulus

# Internal working documents. The decision log and the differential findings are
# deliberation rather than product: they name unreleased reasoning, half-settled
# positions and the reproduction of every place this server disagrees with the
# one it mirrors. SPEC.md deliberately stays tracked — the E2E gate parses it to
# derive the behavior catalog's universe (§19.2), so a checkout without it
# cannot run the gate at all.
/internalDocs/
